our next guest that ring especially true  when two co-workers who had known each  other for years  discovered something shocking through a  mutual friend on facebook take a look  meet sandy sandrick and alan tucker two  friends and co-workers with quite a  story to share  my name is sandy sandrick i was born in  phoenix arizona  i am currently a trauma nurse at santa  thunderbird medical center  my name is alan tucker i grew up in a  little town in kansas  i am currently a trauma nurse at banner  thunderbird  medical center when i was 11 my parents  told me i was adopted  they told me who my birth mother was but  they didn't have any information about  my birth father  sandy and alan are both now married with  children and interestingly enough  have more than that in common my  adopted parents passed away then then my  birth mother got in contact with me  she told me that my biological dad would  want to know that i was okay  she just blurted his name out and said  he would be interested to meet you  so i sent him a private message on  facebook  and when i looked at his friend list  that's when i saw allen's name  one day i came to work i saw  sandy and she looked a little nervous  when i saw him i told him that i needed  to talk to him i needed to ask him a  question he said how do you know  this guy gary and he said why how do you  know gary  it was kind of this unreal moment  that felt right it was a moment  that would change their lives forever  okay sandy and alan are here now sandy  allen hi  hi how are you guys  good how are you good i'm so excited to  talk about your story so you come  together  you ask how you know gary  what happens next he said  that he was his dad and i said it was my  dad too  what is the first sort of thing that you  say after that realization  oh wow uh that was quite a day  we were busy at work we were doing  traumas  and kovid and uh throughout the day it  just kind of sunk in  uh we have the same father and she's my  sister  yeah do you like check in and you're  like hey me again okay by the way how  crazy is that sibling thing okay  okay yeah i mean it's so mind-blowing  and  you know looking back now have you like  gone wow  look at all those similarities like the  fact that we do the same thing  yeah definitely we we've noticed that we  have a lot of similarities  it's crazy i'm just so glad that you  guys have been brought together and alan  you have other siblings right  um sandy have you met them i've talked  to them on the phone one time  but we're we're getting that arranged we  just work schedules and  kids schedules and all that has been  hard but we're working on that  well i have a little surprise for you  both please meet your other brothers  clint and dustin are joining us now  oh clint and dustin i'm so happy to meet  you guys  i feel like i'm in the middle of such a  wonderful  incredible family moment uh clint and  dustin did you have something that you  wanted to say to sandy  no yeah i'm just excited well  good news this is a perfect example of  what a family reunion in 2021 looks like  and  sounds like and feels like so we want to  ditch the zoom  and get you guys together and as soon as  it's safe we want you to set sail aboard  the catalina express ferry to beautiful  catalina island oh you'll enjoy  a five night stay in a luxury condo at  the hamilton cove villas  and enjoy some of the greatest beachside  cuisine courtesy of love catalina island  tourism authority and oh my gosh  then you guys can thank you  that's amazing i can't wait excited  that's exciting yep  thank you sandy allen clint and dustin  for  sharing this with us we can't wait to  check back in  and hear all about it congratulations on  finding each other  thank you so much
 

